<title>UK: World Bank sets NZ$600 mln 10-yr zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets NZ$600 mln 10-yr zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond was announced by lead manager TD Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$600 MLN    COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    20.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB/NZ</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED CURVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
